{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0053_1000_p", "source_sha256": "da63f1c36ed3e7184728bfca0c44c0b3abfe25f5c8960b82c6abb5e41376a68d", "ja": "（『4 Luxury』が出演したドラマの高視聴率を\n受けて、メンバーへの仕事のオファーが急増中だ）", "zh": "（由于『4 Luxury』演出的电视剧获得高收视率，\n发给成员们的工作邀约正在急速增加。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0053_1001_p", "source_sha256": "7d4412e77de8cc4b9521f9e1cb6f0925ed57ce941e07a99788233a64056aa10c", "ja": "今日の仕事は……お、来た来た。\n風花！", "zh": "今天的工作是……哦，来了来了。\n风花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0053_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "45f04b9e78ddec25962a98a0b78f0deafe1f645d095ea9fe83d253da4b146550", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです♪\n……あの、じっと見つめたりして、どうかしましたか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，工作辛苦了♪\n……请问，你一直盯着我看，是怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0053_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "05d0af330ca92f9400a7f61e515cebfb883aa900f7d631b7cac6d20d350057fb", "ja": "私の顔、何かヘンですか？　あ、もしかして\n急いで来たからお化粧が崩れてるとか……！？", "zh": "我的脸哪里怪怪的吗？\n啊，难不成是因为赶着过来，脸上的妆花了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0053_1004_p", "source_sha256": "cb0f6a49f1c49a8bbd191cdc7b9be4c98d9981fa1a0c67384d671808324f8a6c", "ja": "いや、そうじゃなくて……風花、なんだか\nすごく綺麗になったな。何か特別な事でもしてるのか？", "zh": "不，不是那样……风花，总觉得你变得好漂亮。\n你有特别做了什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0053_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6cc49fd8a4c243568d186f377248079fb91d0fe9d96def0844d170c6c24ac6ae", "ja": "えっ……き、綺麗だなんてそんな！\nあ、でも、あれのせいかも……？", "zh": "咦……哪、哪有漂亮啦！\n啊，不过，可能是因为那个的缘故……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0053_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9830328c9b0b6e8827c87d0ee526aeb8268e41a95ac437040aef741dc41747a2", "ja": "あれ？", "zh": "那个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0053_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e5f76456bb196adfd1795ce5ee4b0ba74daf9bc1accc4862f9291d716bed016e", "ja": "はい。実は、あれから歌織さんと一緒に、\n莉緒さんから教えてもらったエステに通ってるんです。", "zh": "是的。其实自从上次之后，\n我常常和歌织一起去莉绪告诉我们的美容沙龙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0053_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6f58d9aff83bdb225a59772b5b67c7556a96fa49e84b62d81b3b874aae93e967", "ja": "そうだったのか。\nエステ、そんなに気に入ったのか？", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n你这么喜欢去护肤吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0053_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ae8df7370dd9b9fe3b7947699c537e93e6efeb11ccfa7a59614159d356a6ed94", "ja": "はい♪　あ、エステが気持ちよかったのもありますけど\n私達のユニットって、『4 Luxury』なので……。", "zh": "是啊♪啊，一方面当然也是由于护肤很舒服，\n不过主要是因为我们的团体叫做『4 Luxury』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0053_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b2480cfe2801cd476b5ea073f1e61e4c285dc5d38a2f49519ea3be6b691aa98f", "ja": "名前のとおり、ゴージャスな大人の女性の雰囲気も\nこれからは出せていけたらな……なんて♪", "zh": "我希望自己今后能如同团名一样，\n散发出奢华的成熟女性气质……开玩笑的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0053_1011_p", "source_sha256": "08a021d75da618f43a651167037fabd7db0b1491629d49a78eb7851019dfc659", "ja": "そうか。風花、本当に前向きになってきたな。\nいい傾向だと思うぞ！", "zh": "这样啊。风花，你变得很积极呢。\n我觉得这是好现象喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0053_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "68b5e809600b5373966f82ac59ea0f92142036c862d8d8d3c403acc08bdbfd16", "ja": "ふふっ。あ、{$P$}さん。\n今日のお仕事も、大人の女性役なんですよね？", "zh": "呵呵。啊，{$P$}先生。\n今天的工作，我也是扮演成熟女性对吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0053_1013_p", "source_sha256": "55560f14b2f9e713fe57befd02062a6158b5891f25b64c29482a25e5badba7a4", "ja": "ああ、そう聞いてるよ。グラビア撮影だから、台詞は\n特にないはずだけど。あ、これがコンセプトだそうだ。", "zh": "嗯，我是这么听说。因为是拍写真照，应该没台词。\n啊，这个好像是拍摄主题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0053_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7d06cbab0d896bfbfd6dbd009777179ecdcf456885f53bf56edd5917e452f001", "ja": "わぁっ、ありがとうございます♪\n……ん？　あ、あれ？", "zh": "哇，谢谢你♪\n……嗯？奇、奇怪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0053_1015_p", "source_sha256": "9c98af1108aae987de649551034900f45ac6169d10ef6ea99ab9c501392b39a1", "ja": "どうかしたのか？", "zh": "怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0053_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e66ed6695daab36d43c4f6cf9770f7820bf77168e67fac9e6d157b7bb3affc1d", "ja": "あの～、{$P$}さん。これ、\n本当に私が……というか、グラビアなんですか……？", "zh": "那个～{$P$}先生。\n这个，真的要我来拍吗……话说，这算写真照吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0053_1017_p", "source_sha256": "3fd5d99379504870b5f0e1b50a95095b839b9ac87c9ed72c2f7413b3dacb7b84", "ja": "どれどれ？　え～っと……コンセプトは、\n悪の女幹部、魔女、女医……。そして女教師……。", "zh": "我看看，呃……主题有：\n邪恶女干部、魔女、女医师……还有女教师……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0053_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1b4bcf38bd5098d230899bafd771547e6e6e1a2ace21285d06db6e5cb265fcaf", "ja": "う……っ。", "zh": "唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0053_1019_p", "source_sha256": "d6c07f377517f2436c93aaba8120fee399c0bb5b34b3741d6dd7f657088eac58", "ja": "なるほど……。\nすごく、大人の女性的な役だな……。", "zh": "原来如此……\n是非常有成熟女性感觉的角色呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0053_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5c9e7d166fdb9244450ce55ecbe9e07b5f2247267549628eaf5d1cf550f32d2e", "ja": "そうですけど、そうじゃなくてー！\n……ううっ、やっぱりこんなのはイヤぁ～！", "zh": "是没错啦，但重点不是那个──！\n……呜呜，我实在不想走这种路线啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
